OL,3,GNEWSACockroach-infested restaurant
OL,4,Aclosed for second time for having no
OL,5,Ahot water
OL,6,
OL,7,FA restaurant owner and his company have
OL,8,Fbeen fined more than #3,500 after a
OL,9,Fcockroach infestation was found
OL,10,Ffollowing a tip off from a member of
OL,11,Fthe public.
OL,13,FMotiur Rahman, 51, from Cardiff, who
OL,14,Fowned Spice Kitchen Ltd, pleaded guilty
OL,15,Fat Cardiff Magistrates' Court on 2
OL,16,FSeptember to food hygiene offences.
OL,18,FAn investigation at his premises in
OL,19,FBirchgrove, then trading as Delhi
OL,20,FCuisine, in October of 2024 found the
OL,21,Fbusiness had been open and trading
OL,22,Fduring a cockroach infestation.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
